title: Cloudflare KV Global
agents: cloudflare
catalog: cloud/cloudflare
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the overall Cloudflare KV usage for the account.
 It reports daily reads/writes/deletes/lists against included free-tier
 thresholds (Free: 100K reads, 1K writes/deletes/lists per day).
 Paid plans are usage-based and free-tier monitoring can be disabled in the ruleset.

discovery:
 One service is created per Cloudflare account.
